                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "(Disclaimer, just a personal opinion of mine)\r\n\r\nFirst review:\r\nAbsolutely enjoy the premise and storytelling. It is a wonderful visual novel that made me fall in love with the characters almost immediately. I would like to express how I felt about the game after putting in 13 hours at the time of this review but I fear I cannot properly convey it. I've only done Michiru's route so far and she is by far my favorite among all the girls in this visual novel. Her connection and endearing love for the MC + how she is as a character was a main driving factor for me to want to do her route first and foremost. It was by all means cinematic and lovely to see how these two bonded after many conflicts of inner turmoil and emotions. I love Michiru and the MC being together, it'll be difficult for me to do the other routes while not thinking about Michiru lol. Some may not like their relationship as it touches upon a certain \"controversy\" but I'm actually into their whole relationship so it was a joyful ride. I only wish her route was a bit longer to touch more upon the two's bonding after a certain ending (but I won't spoil it).\r\n\r\nOverall I do approve of this visual novel as its quite light-hearted but can be serious in heart-wrenching moments. I might review it a 2nd time after the next route I do.",
